<td id="A2.T6.4.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Linear, GELU, Linear</td>
<td id="A2.T6.4.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Expert logits (per patch)</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T6.4.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T6.4.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">PER</td>
