<td id="A2.T6.4.1.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb"><span id="A2.T6.4.1.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Attn</span> pooling; 3-layer MLP (SiLU, dropout)</td>
<td id="A2.T6.4.1.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">Teacher logits (per patch/layer)</td></tr>
